   "text": "An emotional Andrew Webster said the bunker was “trying to find ways” to take decisions away from the Warriors in controversial calls against them in their agonising 12-10 loss to the Knights.\nThe Warriors have been eliminated from the NRL finals after back-to-back defeats in Auckland and went down to Newcastle in a tense semifinal at Eden Park on Sunday night.\nWarriors coach Webster was frustrate",
